# WHAT NEVER ENTERS AN IMAGE BUILD (PRR 2026-09-29, OPS-12).
#
# The Dockerfiles copy whole directories (packages, apps/web, ...). On the CI
# runner that is a clean checkout; on a laptop it is also every node_modules,
# every build output and every .env file in those directories — hundreds of
# megabytes sent to the daemon, and secrets one COPY away from a layer.
# Mirrors .gitignore: a build starts from what is committed, nothing else.
.git
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.next-*
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/test-results-sim
**/playwright-report
**/.mail-gallery
**/.local
**/*.log
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
apps/web/public/_media
apps/web/next-env.d.ts
